    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Impressive 4 bed period townhouse with side access and rear yard. Offering a well maintained interior the property is set over 3 floors and features many character details. Superbly situated on Skibbereens main thoroughfare adjacent all local amenities.\r\nServices: Oil fired central heating, mains services, fibre broadband, fire safety system"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall - 10.0m x 2.2m \r\nTiled floor, feature exposed stone wall, original wooden staircase, high ceiling, fan light over door\r\n\r\nBedroom 1/Office - 4.0m x 2.6m \r\nTwo panel walls, high ceiling\r\n\r\nLiving Room - 4.2m x 3.4m \r\nTiled floor, closet, high ceiling\r\n\r\nUtility Room - 2.2m x 1.2m \r\nTiled floor, counter, fridge, shelving\r\n\r\nWashroom - 2.2m x 1.8m \r\nTiled flor, shower unit, wash hand basin, w.c.\r\n\r\nHalf Landing - 2.0m x 2.0m \r\nTiled floor, original wooden staircase\r\n\r\nWashroom/Utility - 2.0m x 1.5m \r\nTiled floor, dryer, wash hand basin, w.c.\r\n\r\nLanding - 4.0m x 2.6m \r\nWooden floor, original wooden staircase\r\n\r\nSitting Room - 5.1m x 4.1m \r\nWooden floor, cast iron fireplace with tiled inlay, picture rail. original cornicing and centre rose\r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining Room - 6.0m x 4.0m \r\nContemporary high gloss kitchen, gas hob, electric oven, extractor, integrated dishwasher, washing machine\r\n\r\nStudy - 2.8m x 2.6m \r\n\r\n\r\nLanding - 3.6m x 3.0m \r\nWooden floor\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - 4.4m x 4.0m \r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 - 3.5m x 3.0m \r\nWooden floor, traditional cast iron fireplace\r\n\r\nBedroom 4 - 4.0m x 3.2m \r\nRiver views\r\n\r\nBathroom - 2.8m x 2.6m \r\nTiled floor, hotpress, shower unit, wash hand basin, w.c.\r\n\r\nStore - 3.0m x 2.0m \r\n\r\n\r\n"
